207 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Ginkgo Bioworks operates in the field of synthetic biology, based on the principle that living cells can be genetically programmed to manufacture useful products. The company rewrites the DNA of microorganisms such as bacteria and yeast so they produce specific molecules including drug ingredients, vaccine components, enzymes, fragrances, and sustainable materials. Instead of slow, traditional lab experimentation, Ginkgo uses robotics, automation, and artificial intelligence to test thousands of genetic designs in parallel and rapidly optimize them. Having raised billions of dollars and partnered with major pharmaceutical, chemical, and agriculture companies, Ginkgo has demonstrated that biology can be engineered and scaled like software, making it one of the most influential platforms in modern biotechnology)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
